    Levels equal or exceed the Level of the Ritual Monster you Ritual Summon. During
    your Main Phase, except the turn this card was sent to the GY: You can shuffle
    this card into the Deck; add 1 "End of the World" from your Deck to your hand,
    then, you can add 1 "Ruin, Queen of Oblivion" or "Demise, King of Armageddon"
    from your GY to your hand.'
